---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
---

<Base title="Donate">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Donate"
    title="Help us get children back into learning"
    lede="Every rupee of our pre-registration crowdfunded projects was publicly tracked, and we extend the same rigour to every grant."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0">Current funded ask: the 28-child NIOS pilot</h2>
      <p>
        We are raising funds for a specific pilot: teaching, mentoring, and supporting 28 identified children through
        NSF's <a href="/programs">NIOS re-engagement track</a>. What we need funds for:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>A stable classroom:</strong> rent and furniture for a secure space for the year, rather than informal,
          exposed setups (like under a flyover) that proved vulnerable to demolition and disruption in the past
        </li>
        <li><strong>NIOS enrolment and exam fees</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Teacher stipends</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Learning materials</strong> (books, etc.)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we ensure we are using the money well</h2>
      <p>
        We set a goal for each child, based on their individual needs and age, and track their progress through the
        year. We'll use this pilot to inform tweaks to the model, which we hope to scale to the hundreds of other
        children in this community who have the same need. As we spend funds, we will publish a ledger here with receipts for transparency.
      </p>

      <div class="btn-row" style="margin:28px 0">
        <a class="btn accent" href="https://milaap.org/fundraisers/support-childen-who-have-dropped-out-of-school">Donate to the pilot on Milaap</a>
      </div>

      <h2>Donate directly to the NGO bank account</h2>
      <div class="upi">
        <img src="/images/donate/upi-qr.png" alt="UPI QR code for M S Navyug Sanskriti Foundation, Indian Bank" />
        <div>
          <p>
            Scan the QR code with any UPI app (BHIM, Google Pay, PhonePe, Paytm), or pay to the UPI ID
            <strong>navyugsanskriti@indianbnk</strong> (M S Navyug Sanskriti Foundation, Indian Bank).
          </p>
          <p>
            For an 80G receipt, email us at <a href="mailto:srishtimalik3011@gmail.com">srishtimalik3011@gmail.com</a>
            with your name, PAN, and the transaction reference.
          </p>
          <p><a href="/nsf-upi-qr.pdf" download>Download the QR code (PDF)</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="callout accent">
        <h3 style="margin-top:0">Other ways to give</h3>
        <p>
          For NEFT/RTGS transfers, CSR funding, or other questions, please contact us at
          <a href="mailto:srishtimalik3011@gmail.com">srishtimalik3011@gmail.com</a> or
          call <a href="tel:+919582081405">+91 95820 81405</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          NSF holds 80G approval (provisional, Unique Registration No. AAETN8217AF20251), so Indian donors can claim
          tax deductions. We are also CSR-1 registered (CSR00113586) and eligible to receive corporate CSR funding.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
